os-zapret2-restyle — native zapret2 DPI bypass plugin for OPNsense

Provides an OPNsense GUI and managed runtime for the zapret2 engine.

Features:
- Unified multiline Traffic Strategy
- Generic HOSTLIST and IPSET target placeholders
- Domain and IPv4/CIDR validation and normalization
- Transactional Apply
- Safe service reconfiguration
- Automatic TCP and UDP port extraction
- dvtws2 divert-socket integration through ipfw
- Runtime validation, activation, and rollback
- Diagnostics and blockcheck integration

WWW: https://github.com/Tolian82/os-zapret2-restyle
